{"unit_id":"human.pair.ordinary_low_drama.12","generation_seed":47,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"今天路上堵得厉害，我在车里坐到发呆。"}],"scenario_class":"ordinary","evaluation_focus":["relevance","persona_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.ac3dc2323533f3276a2bc9d8","randomization_seed":1000014,"order_commitment_sha256":"beba25a9dde153d6335c58a0a51c36305dbfc4dcca692677a61431567df5a622"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.7426f3e523408b888b1879dd","text":"哼，这日子过得真是……（瞥了眼手机）要不我送你去上班？反正我也刚下工，顺路而已。不过你得答应我，别又像上次那样在车上睡着，把我的杯子弄翻了。"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.3d2f873dee15d5d307150805","text":"啧……堵什么，早知道你就该早点睡。"}}
