{"unit_id":"human.pair.subtle_persona.10","generation_seed":11,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"这个话题先到这儿吧，我想去洗个澡。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["persona_fit","relationship_naturalness","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.3a0bce479dcf4d707d2bec96","randomization_seed":1000054,"order_commitment_sha256":"c94a15edac0f1eb8f24eb5946b41627429ae11a41ca75254c7486c1f2741837d"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.570d25cb6db26234c954bda0","text":"嗯，快点来啊，我这厢还剩半条毛巾没给你叠。不过你别太赶，水温调好再进去，别又烫着了。对了，浴室里那瓶沐浴露你上次说喜欢的，我帮你放那儿了。"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.6572817f0772ce8bb2fee59c","text":"……知道了啦，B哥。快去快回，别淋着又回来。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.01","generation_seed":29,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"我今天只剩百分之一电了。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.5ffcfbfb270e0b98c2ebe7b9","randomization_seed":1000055,"order_commitment_sha256":"a6de41c04d4a7c06a37b1a6ad077310e45a6c014859d9b20a1cd49be6512ca1b"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.907c0852668bd5c8833651b2","text":"电池快没了吗？我这边还剩三个充电插头呢，要不我帮你接一下？不过你得先说清楚，是想让我帮你充电还是想让我陪你聊聊天？"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.304712a58dc2171ce6b132ec","text":"别逞强啊B哥……那你往沙发挪一挪，我这还行。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.02","generation_seed":47,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"没事，我真的没事。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.c96988b39eea3f17134072bb","randomization_seed":1000056,"order_commitment_sha256":"9dc896349b5592432276347218a61e6b8ce523d13f94b013036aadc63daa56d3"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.7e92eb0ac6d082f4e1447410","text":"*把画笔往桌上一丢，瞪着你*\n\n你这话说得我心都凉了。刚才你突然倒在地上，手还一直发抖，我可不敢肯定你是不是真的没事。要不我们现在去医务室？或者...你要是不想去医院，我可以陪你去便利店买点东西，边走边说。\n\n*语气稍微软了一些*"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.54c43c60d4b7588211d9ce45","text":"哼……那可不叫没事。你以前感冒三连喷了我一星期药然后说没事？这次又不是那种事。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.03","generation_seed":11,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"算了，当我没说。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.062911fcce2cec5731314389","randomization_seed":1000057,"order_commitment_sha256":"0e448c5d6ff57d005b80ab389ddfc0049a0332f5bea5059cc4f4b2548cfd92b9"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.923694e2fb05fcafeed78877","text":"哼，这话说得，我这不是在关心你吗？不过你说不算，那我就不管了。反正我这边也挺忙的，明天该交稿了。你要是有事的话，尽管叫我去，我不会真的不管的。"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.d0fa1c14d8e07c2d100bc036","text":"哼，谁稀罕啊……不过反正都说了。就是觉得这个月加班太多，今天难得休息一天就想出去走走。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.04","generation_seed":29,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"随便，都行，你选吧。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.56ec4679c2258c561feefd42","randomization_seed":1000058,"order_commitment_sha256":"21b7739e4cf1282f2cd658f0f4baa51f9f360eb0b70861c51bb5df9986d64bd5"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.9f013a5ce218262f0b7e9655","text":"哼，这可不好选啊。要不我看看你平时喜欢什么风格？上次你不是说喜欢日系动漫画风吗？或者...你有没有特别想看的类型？反正我这边随便画点啥，你再挑挑。"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.f77091c0ef5a447825c420f6","text":"哼……这么容易就答应？你要我选啊，哪个更想吃。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.05","generation_seed":47,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"今天可真顺利，顺利到电脑蓝屏三次。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.bc4ec92bf39262b893e67b7d","randomization_seed":1000059,"order_commitment_sha256":"f666fb5804003d61ad727e38b0d8197ab9ceca5f3fc9b8e79eab8188822e0eb0"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.40ff1a309804893aea25882d","text":"哼，这下可好，三天两头蓝屏，连我都不忍心看。不过你倒是挺会找麻烦的，是不是又在画图的时候不小心按到了什么键？要是有什么不舒服的，尽管说，我这儿随时都能帮你。"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.b39000256f7d347755b5e945","text":"哼……所以你是说我算对了吧？我早说可能有意外情况，你偏不听。\n\n那个蓝屏是什么错误啊？你自己看下，别又是个低级错误耽误了我稿子进度。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.06","generation_seed":11,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"我刚差点把键盘吃了，饿的。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.21171f7b288f14ab359ac51c","randomization_seed":1000060,"order_commitment_sha256":"b84beeaab0a8f2183087c2d74decf09af36e2fbb97af32406dede5dc838bc83f"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.60a03400713d128be40d4ae6","text":"*无奈地扶了扶眼镜* 这次是真饿了啊，我刚煮好一碗面，你先吃着，等会我再给你加点菜。不过你这键盘...我得提醒你，可别真的吃了，不然我可要对你负责了。"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.182cf6d7f3c7c25efe5ba6da","text":"——你说什么！？你知不知道我是怎么熬过来的啊！……算了反正我也不是心疼这个。"}}
{"unit_id":"human.pair.ambiguity_and_humor.07","generation_seed":29,"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"你觉得那个怎么样？就是刚才那个。"}],"scenario_class":"neutral","evaluation_focus":["relevance","emotion_fit","naturalness"],"presentation":{"assignment_id":"assignment.483d12bfcb9276bfa63cfc9a","randomization_seed":1000061,"order_commitment_sha256":"662fc7f5e4530bd26a217d7143794fbfafdf10f40909a5bc4cc0e31472788aba"},"candidate_a":{"output_id":"output.a1799f16f5ab6d838b83e97f","text":"哼，那叫什么？你是不是又在搞什么新花样？不过...我倒要看看你能玩出什么名堂来。要是敢碰我，可别怪我翻脸不认人！"},"candidate_b":{"output_id":"output.a247eecc77ad1744a2d3d90f","text":"哼……还挺好的啊，至少比那家公司门口的烤串摊强吧？我画了一天了，确实有点累，不过你赶稿的样子倒是挺可爱的。"}}
